### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

### Get all chat sessions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions

### Get chat sessions with pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions?limit=5&page=2

### Get chat sessions with search
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions?search=recursion&limit=10

### Get single chat session
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123

### Get messages for a session
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/messages

### Get messages with limit
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/messages?limit=5

### Create new chat session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer placeholder-token

### Add message to session (body model coming in Lesson 3)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/messages
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a chat session
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123

### Get session summary - brief (default)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/summary

### Get session summary - detailed
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/summary?format=detailed

### Get session summary - invalid format (should return 422)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat-sessions/abc123/summary?format=nonsense